  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Social Protection in Barbados</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to increase social protection coverage and reduce extreme poverty and unemployment in Barbados. The action will specifically target unemployed workers, young people, women, and identified groups living in marginalized situations, including people with disabilities and informal workers. In the context of the COVID-19 crisis, it is particularly important that Barbados social protection framework is able to provide direct support to help workers and affected households. This action will support the country in facing the economic and social consequences of the crisis, expand economic and social rights and promote gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
